# Base URL of the kredoc-daily-update Cloudflare Worker (no trailing slash).
# Not a secret — the client only ever issues an unauthenticated GET against it.
# See worker/README.md for deploying the Worker itself; FAMILY_ACCESS_TOKEN
# (which now guards only the manual rebuild, run from a terminal) lives as a
# Worker secret, never in this file or any VITE_-prefixed variable.
VITE_WORKER_URL=https://kredoc-daily-update.your-subdomain.workers.dev
